"description":"CareCircle helps families coordinate care for elderly parents, disabled loved ones, or patients recovering at home. Built for caregivers, by caregivers.\n\n  ALL DATA STAYS ON YOUR DEVICE — no accounts, no cloud, no tracking.\n\n  FREE FEATURES:\n  • Task management with priorities and assignments\n  • Medication tracking and logging\n  • Visit calendar and scheduling\n  • Shared care notes\n  • Emergency contacts with quick access\n  • Vitals tracking (BP, temperature, heart rate, weight, blood sugar, oxygen)\n  • Companion Mode — simplified interface for care receivers\n\n  PREMIUM FEATURES ($5.99 one-time):\n  • Care schedule and shift planning\n  • Medical appointments\n  • Expense tracker\n  • Meal planner\n  • Document vault\n  • Caregiver wellness resources\n  • Symptom tracking and daily summaries\n  • Care team directory\n  • Communication log\n  • 10 reference guides (safety, legal, medication, emergency, mobility, and more)", "trackCensoredName":"CareCircle Caregiving", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/carecircle-caregiving/id6763921508?uo=4", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":0, "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "sellerUrl":"https://bpupadhyaya.github.io", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"3189760", "formattedPrice":"Free", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "trackId":6763921508, "trackName":"CareCircle Caregiving", "userRatingCount":0}, 
