"releaseNotes":"• Smarter weather alerts.\nAlerts are now personalized based on your loved one's age, health conditions, and medications, so you get warnings and advice that apply to them.\n\n• Find Help, improved.\nEnhanced navigation with quick start suggestions, more accurate results, and additional resources to help families match with elder care professionals and services.\n\n• New Trusted Network categories.\nExpanded to include Long-Term Care Insurance, Reverse Mortgages, and Senior Fitness & Exercise.\n\n• tenderID.\nRegister for tendercare's free emergency information system in-app. First responders get critical information instantly.\n\n• Medication list export.\nCreate and share a current medication list as a PDF, ready to bring to any appointment or hand off to a caregiver.\n\n• A refreshed tendercare Plan experience.\nClearer next steps, built around your loved one's specific situation.\n\n• UX improvements and bug fixes.", "primaryGenreName":"Health & Fitness", "primaryGenreId":6013, "sellerName":"TenderCo Inc", "minimumOsVersion":"15.1", "genreIds":["6013", "6020"], "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "version":"1.133", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Caring for an aging parent is one of the hardest things you'll do. tendercare is the front door to elder care. One free place to get organized, prepare for emergencies, and find trusted local help, so you can show up confidently for the people who matter most.\n\nORGANIZE WHAT MATTERS\nKeep medical records, insurance cards, legal documents, and medication lists in one secure Vault. Connect a Medicare account to automatically sync conditions, medications, and doctors. Everything is labeled, organized, and ready when you need it.\n\nBE READY FOR EMERGENCIES\nSet up your free tenderID, a fridge decal, and wallet card with a QR code that gives first responders instant access to your loved one's critical information. First responders get what they need immediately, no app required on their end. You're alerted right away.\n\nKNOW WHAT TO DO NEXT\nNot sure where to start? tendercare builds a personalized tendercare Plan based on your loved one's situation, so you have clear next steps, not open questions.\n\nFIND TRUSTED LOCAL HELP\nThe tendercare Trusted Network of vetted elder care providers. Tell us what you need help with, and we connect you with 441,000+ professionals across 20+ categories in all 50 states. Every Verified Member has earned their place through 20+ hours of vetting across track record, licensure, insurance, and reputation.\n\nSTAY ON TOP OF IT TOGETHER\nGet proactive reminders for appointments, renewals, and next steps. Invite siblings or other caregivers so everyone sees the same information and nothing gets missed.\n\nCONNECT WITH FREE AND COVERED SUPPORT\nWe help you find and sign up for Medicare-covered support programs your family may qualify for.\n\nPRIVATE AND SECURE\ntendercare is HIPAA-aligned and uses bank-level encryption. Your information is never sold, shared, or used for advertising. Free for families, always.\n\nVisit our Terms and Conditions: https://www.trytendercare.com/terms-and-conditions/", "trackCensoredName":"tendercare - for families", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/tendercare-for-families/id1658816779?uo=4", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":41, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.6585400000000003473132892395369708538055419921875, "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "sellerUrl":"https://www.trytendercare.com/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"90369024", "formattedPrice":"Free", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.6585400000000003473132892395369708538055419921875, "trackId":1658816779, "trackName":"tendercare - for families", "userRatingCount":41}, 
